{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519480/extras/e7a5ff2917ab3e7c30291f51e3b02b24.avif?t=1759759167\" width=616 height=155 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the renowned YouTube channel <strong>HistoryMarche</strong>, <i>Carthage: Bellum Punicum</i> brings historical battles to life with a focus on strategic depth and authenticity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519480/extras/27374f9a9067b665d7eb881587223a96.poster.avif?t=1759759167\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519480/extras/27374f9a9067b665d7eb881587223a96.webm?t=1759759167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519480/extras/27374f9a9067b665d7eb881587223a96.mp4?t=1759759167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HISTORICAL BATTLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive iconic clashes like Cannae, Trasimene, and Trebia, fought on  meticulously crafted battlemaps based on detailed historical sources, bringing the intensity and precision of ancient warfare to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519480/extras/dac49901b43ebc4eb6b50967615f57ec.poster.avif?t=1759759167\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519480/extras/dac49901b43ebc4eb6b50967615f57ec.webm?t=1759759167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519480/extras/dac49901b43ebc4eb6b50967615f57ec.mp4?t=1759759167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BATTLEFIELD DYNAMICS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Issue orders to your troops that take time to arrive through messengers, requiring careful planning and adaptability. Master morale, stamina, terrain, and organization to execute complex strategies and outmaneuver your enemies on the ever-changing battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519480/extras/bb6fdd94d27c363111053e16ff7752cd.poster.avif?t=1759759167\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519480/extras/bb6fdd94d27c363111053e16ff7752cd.webm?t=1759759167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHALLENGING AI</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a highly competent opponent that flanks, retreats, and adapts to your moves. The AI reflects the unique strategies of different historical factions, from the Roman <i>Acies Triplex</i> formations to the Iberians\u2019 relentless harassment tactics, ensuring every battle feels fresh and demanding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519480/extras/d9e7dfeec19b0dcd0e35b73116a6aaad.poster.avif?t=1759759167\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519480/extras/d9e7dfeec19b0dcd0e35b73116a6aaad.webm?t=1759759167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519480/extras/d9e7dfeec19b0dcd0e35b73116a6aaad.mp4?t=1759759167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CAMPAIGN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience Hannibal Barca\u2019s epic march from Carthage to Italy in his legendary war against Rome. Clash with Iberians, Gauls, and Roman legions as you carve a path through history. Face hundreds of dynamic events where your choices shape the campaign. Manage vulnerable supply lines through mountains and hostile lands\u2014every move matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519480/extras/59548a0306735e02e8aea9fc67de4562.avif?t=1759759167\" width=616 height=256 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3519480?t=1759759167","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519480/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759759167","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519480/65c9ea6188cb8b8bc276b215bcb743b960058e8b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759759167","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519480/65c9ea6188cb8b8bc276b215bcb743b960058e8b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759759167","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519480/extras/e7a5ff2917ab3e7c30291f51e3b02b24.avif?t=1759759167\" width=616 height=155 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the renowned YouTube channel <strong>HistoryMarche</strong>, <i>Carthage: Bellum Punicum</i> brings historical battles to life with a focus on strategic depth and authenticity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steam